# Data

- Preserve immutable source bytes and checksum in Bronze when legally permitted.
- Silver normalizes; Gold serves stable, documented metrics.
- Each pipeline supports dry-run, resume and idempotency keys.
- Quarantine invalid records; never silently discard them.
- Validate SQL syntax, referenced columns and contracts before execution.
- Consolidate BigQuery ALTER operations and avoid rate-limit-prone loops.
- Publishing requires quality status APPROVED and human homologation when specified.
- Every projection exposes formula, source, base year, assumptions and confidence.

